{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oDTIaUZ7r91794528417.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>聯邦儲備局更新明年公開市場委員會的會議日程，取消10月常規利率決議，將改為貨幣政策討論。</p><p></p><p>聯儲局公布2027年公開市場委員會修訂後的暫定會議日程。全年計劃舉行8次會議，其中於10月26至27日會議，將專門討論廣泛的貨幣政策戰略問題，不按常規在第二日公布利率決議。聯儲局主席沃什在10月份議息會議後表示，2027年將有一次會議不討論貨幣政策，2028年增加至兩次相關安排。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:53:09.083952+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":185,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T00:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.236608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T00:46:30.850652+00:00","content_hash":"971793bfc1f95cda089dc8b3ee4989b6e1e2725aa1539e2b857de2c005af610d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:53:09.083952+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}